{"id":"act39side_level_act39side_06_beg","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"57_g2_saltdesert_n","screenadapt":"coverall","block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_wind","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","duration":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#8$1","duration":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#8$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Pascuala","text":"(Whisper) I can't believe she'd let us leave... I thought for sure we'd be tied up and handed over to the Inquisition."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"(Whisper) Shh..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","duration":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","duration":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"I know no amount of apologies will make up for your loss."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"I suppose this is the end, Isidro."},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"You needn't worry. I don't blame you. It's not your fault. I accepted the consequences when I made my choice."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"I know it was you who bore the brunt of your crew's wrath for us, and I know it was you who saved Pascuala's life."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"...Maybe you could come with us."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"You would certainly be in grave danger if you stay, señora."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"Go. Weren't you discussing how you'd escape earlier? Here's your chance."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"I'm the leader of the fleet. I won't abandon my crew. This was my oath to Cruz, and one which I will never turn my back on."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"Señora Juana... there's something I need to return to you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"You can keep the clothes and the sword. Consider it payment for your troubles."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"No, not that."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#5$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"What else is there?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The young man reaches into his pocket, but suddenly stops. He lets out a slow breath..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"And takes out the object."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"showitem","a":{"image":"item_act39side_1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"hideitem","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#5$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"The compass? No..."},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"I... I don't understand. If it's undamaged, then what is that debris in the lab?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"If you haven't been repairing the compass, then what have you been doing?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#4$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":30,"ystrength":30,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"Answer me!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"The destroyed compass was a replica. I never touched the original."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#9$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Whew..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#15$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":15,"ystrength":25,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Pascuala","text":"What?! How come no one ever told me? When'd you make the switch?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"I never told anyone."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"I don't understand. Why?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"The Corazonix in the compass was far more complex than I expected. If I'm unable to replicate it perfectly, that means I haven't understood its true nature."},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"In which case, attempting to manipulate the actual Corazonix could only lead to failure."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"But I couldn't afford to fail. Your hopes, the future of the fleet, the fates of Elysium and Pascuala... all of that was on my shoulders."},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"So if I was doomed to fail, I thought I should at least limit the damage."},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"That's why I tried to replicate the Corazonix. If I proved incapable of understanding it, at least you could keep the original and find a better alchemist."},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"I left some of the materials you gave me behind for the fleet as well."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"I..."},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"I'm sorry. I tried."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"Isidro... is this your idea of giving it your all?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#4$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"The chance of failure was at least 87%... This was the safest way I could think of."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"Are you that afraid of failure? Even if the chance of success were one in ten thousand, I would have wagered everything on it."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"That's not experimentation. That's gambling."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#11$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"Hah... Have you ever considered that the odds of getting a second chance might be even lower?"},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"Tell me, is life a gamble, or an experiment?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Weedy's on her way to pick me up. Are you coming with us?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"...My journey is not yet over."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"I will continue."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"What about you, Pascuala?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#11$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Pascuala","text":"I..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Come with me. I can find a way to get you out of here, at least..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#10$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Pascuala","text":"Alright... Take care, Isidro."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Elysium","text":"Take care."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Isidro","text":"You too. Both of you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"57_g14_ibtown_n","screenadapt":"showall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#2$1","duration":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","duration":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Warrior Priest","text":"Señor Silver."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#2$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Silver","text":"You're willing to stay. Good, very good..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Warrior Priest","text":"Have you forgotten? I've got a bad leg. Can't go."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Silver","text":"...No, I haven't. You were injured during the second raid, correct?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Warrior Priest","text":"See, you have forgotten. It happened on the day of the execution. You treated the wound yourself, but it ended up infected anyway."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Silver","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#3$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Silver","text":"If... hypothetically... if I were a better doctor and fixed your leg then, would you have come with us now?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Warrior Priest","text":"Of course."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Silver","text":"...I see."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","afrom":1,"ato":0,"duration":1,"focus":"r"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#4$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Silver","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#1$1","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Anastasio","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_sandwnd","volume":0,"loop":true,"channel":"s"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"soundvolume","a":{"volume":1,"channel":"s","fadetime":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Anastasio","text":"What were the two of you discussing? It is time."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Silver","text":"Señor Anastasio..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#1$1","focus":"r"}},{"t":"line","name":"Anastasio","text":"Yes?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#6$1","focus":"l"}},{"t":"line","name":"Silver","text":"It is an honor working with you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"s","fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"57_g10_community_n","screenadapt":"showall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":0.6,"channel":"step","loop":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"step","fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#9$1","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Teach","text":"Where were you, señora?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#9$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"...Saw the kids off."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Teach","text":"I did what you told me to."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#7$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"...Take the crew and Nene. Lie low in the Salt Flat for a few days."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Teach","text":"I can't leave you here by yourself."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#7$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Juana","text":"This is an order, Teach."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":0.6,"channel":"step1","loop":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"step1","fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"57_g2_saltdesert_n","screenadapt":"showall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_fssand","channel":"ystep","loop":true,"volume":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"ystep","fadetime":2}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Under the moon, Isidro walks by himself through the Salt Flat, leaving behind a trail of lonely footprints."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"He does not know how long he has walked. The entire night, probably."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"38_g21_skystarry_r2","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"He feels like he has let a lot of people down, but does not know what he did wrong."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Suddenly, he feels lonely and wishes he were with a friend. Then he realizes he just bid farewell to Elysium."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Perhaps Weedy has already found him. Their mission would have come to a close after confirming he was safe."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Perhaps they are discussing the journey out of the Flat and their next mission even now. As for him, he will continue his journey, alone."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Nothing wrong with that. No attachments, no responsibility."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"57_g10_community_n","screenadapt":"showall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1592_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","action":"shake","random":true,"power":5,"times":40,"duration":0.5}},{"t":"line","name":"Tired Sailor","text":"*yawn*"},{"t":"line","name":"Tired Sailor","text":"Shouldn't have had those extra swigs of saltfin garum..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_arrowshot","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_arrowtarget","volume":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1592_1#1